{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/(public)/layout,_N_T_/(public)/about/layout,_N_T_/(public)/about/page,_N_T_/about"}},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--27Wh3M8Zs6LvZy2WwqH6O--><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/css/8ba21ceb50154406.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-116b974ac6a08e65.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4bd1b696-100b9d70ed4e49c1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1255-f5767ca0d1da046a.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/main-app-9b79ea919add8608.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-39c9d338aee346d7.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/app/(public)/about/page-6b2d65511ceaf73c.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>关于我们 - 命理网 - 命理网</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"命理网致力于传承中华传统命理文化，融合现代科技，提供专业、精准的四柱八字、紫微斗数、奇门遁甲、梅花易数等命理测算服务。\"/><meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"八字,紫微斗数,奇门遁甲,梅花易数,命理,排盘,算命,占卜\"/><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"命理网 - 专业命理测算平台\"/><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"提供四柱八字、紫微斗数、奇门遁甲、梅花易数等专业命理测算服务\"/><meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"命理网\"/><meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"zh_CN\"/><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\"/><meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary\"/><meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"命理网 - 专业命理测算平台\"/><meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"提供四柱八字、紫微斗数、奇门遁甲、梅花易数等专业命理测算服务\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-parchment-100\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class=\"sticky top-0 z-50 glass border-b border-parchment-200/60\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-center h-16\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 group\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"relative w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-red-700 via-red-800 to-red-900 flex items-center justify-center shadow-md group-hover:shadow-lg group-hover:scale-105 transition-all\"><span class=\"text-white font-bold text-lg font-kai\">命</span><div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-xl border border-gold/30\"></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><span class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 leading-none font-kai\">命理网</span><span class=\"text-[11px] text-gold tracking-[0.2em] leading-none mt-1\">MINGLI</span></div></a><nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center space-x-1\"><a class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-sm rounded-lg transition-all font-medium relative text-gray-600 hover:text-red-700 hover:bg-red-50/40\" href=\"/\">首页</a><a class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-sm rounded-lg transition-all font-medium relative text-gray-600 hover:text-red-700 hover:bg-red-50/40\" href=\"/bazi\">八字</a><a class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-sm rounded-lg transition-all font-medium relative text-gray-600 hover:text-red-700 hover:bg-red-50/40\" href=\"/ziwei\">紫微</a><a class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-sm rounded-lg transition-all font-medium relative text-gray-600 hover:text-red-700 hover:bg-red-50/40\" href=\"/qimen\">奇门</a><a class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-sm rounded-lg transition-all font-medium relative text-gray-600 hover:text-red-700 hover:bg-red-50/40\" href=\"/meihua\">梅花</a><a class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-sm rounded-lg transition-all font-medium relative text-gray-600 hover:text-red-700 hover:bg-red-50/40\" href=\"/offering\">供奉</a><a class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-sm rounded-lg transition-all font-medium relative text-gray-600 hover:text-red-700 hover:bg-red-50/40\" href=\"/knowledge\">知识</a><a class=\"px-4 py-2.5 text-sm rounded-lg transition-all font-medium relative text-gray-600 hover:text-red-700 hover:bg-red-50/40\" href=\"/membership\">会员</a></nav><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center space-x-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2\"><a class=\"px-4 py-2 text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-red-700 hover:bg-red-50/40 rounded-lg transition-colors font-medium\" href=\"/login\">登录</a><a class=\"btn-primary !py-2 !px-5 text-sm\" href=\"/register\">注册</a></div></div><button class=\"md:hidden p-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-parchment-100 transition-colors\" aria-label=\"菜单\"><svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-gray-700\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><!--$--><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-b from-parchment-50 via-paper to-white py-12\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-mesh-gradient opacity-30 pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10\"><div class=\"page-header\"><div class=\"section-label justify-center\">ABOUT US</div><h1 class=\"page-header-title\"><span>关于命理网</span></h1><p class=\"page-header-subtitle\">传承千年智慧 · 融合现代科技</p></div><div class=\"card mb-8\"><h2 class=\"card-title\">品牌故事</h2><div class=\"prose max-w-none text-gray-700 space-y-4\"><p>命理网成立于2024年，是一群热爱中国传统文化的技术团队和命理学研究者共同打造的在线测算平台。 我们坚信，千年传承的命理智慧不应仅存于古籍之中，而应该借助现代科技的力量，让更多人了解、学习和受益。</p><p>我们的团队汇集了资深命理研究者、算法工程师和UI设计师，致力于将传统的四柱八字、紫微斗数、 奇门遁甲、梅花易数等命理体系，以严谨的算法和优雅的界面呈现给用户。</p></div></div><div class=\"card mb-8\"><h2 class=\"card-title\">我们的优势</h2><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"p-5 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">📚</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">传承经典</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">严格遵循《三命通会》《紫微斗数全书》《遁甲演义》《梅花易数》等经典典籍，算法有据可查。</p></div><div class=\"p-5 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">⚡</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">即时计算</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">采用高性能计算引擎，毫秒级完成排盘，让您即时获取准确的命理分析结果。</p></div><div class=\"p-5 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">🔒</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">隐私保护</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">您的个人信息和排盘记录采用加密存储，严格保护隐私安全，绝不泄露给第三方。</p></div><div class=\"p-5 bg-gray-50 rounded-xl border border-gray-100\"><div class=\"text-3xl mb-3\">💡</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2\">持续更新</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 leading-relaxed\">我们持续优化算法模型，扩展知识库内容，为用户提供越来越精准的命理解读。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"card mb-8\"><h2 class=\"card-title\">服务介绍</h2><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg\"><div class=\"text-4xl flex-shrink-0\">🏛️</div><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1\">四柱八字</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-2\">基于出生年月日时推算四柱八字，分析五行旺衰、十神关系，解读命运密码。提供日主性格分析、大运流年推演、喜用神建议等全面解读。</p><a class=\"text-sm text-red-700 hover:text-red-900 font-medium\" href=\"/bazi\">立即体验 →</a></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg\"><div class=\"text-4xl flex-shrink-0\">⭐</div><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1\">紫微斗数</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-2\">排列十二宫位星曜分布，揭示命宫、财帛、官禄、夫妻等各宫位的主星辅星影响。提供星曜详解、四化飞星分析、命盘综合解读。</p><a class=\"text-sm text-red-700 hover:text-red-900 font-medium\" href=\"/ziwei\">立即体验 →</a></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg\"><div class=\"text-4xl flex-shrink-0\">🔮</div><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1\">奇门遁甲</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-2\">时家奇门排盘，展示九宫八门、九星、八神分布格局。提供方位吉凶、值符值使分析、特殊格局解读，辅助决策趋吉避凶。</p><a class=\"text-sm text-red-700 hover:text-red-900 font-medium\" href=\"/qimen\">立即体验 →</a></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg\"><div class=\"text-4xl flex-shrink-0\">🌸</div><div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1\">梅花易数</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-2\">支持数字、时间、文字、硬币等多种起卦方式，展示本卦、互卦、变卦及体用关系。提供六十四卦详解和爻辞解读。</p><a class=\"text-sm text-red-700 hover:text-red-900 font-medium\" href=\"/meihua\">立即体验 →</a></div></div></div></div><div class=\"card\"><h2 class=\"card-title\">联系我们</h2><div class=\"text-gray-600 space-y-2 text-sm\"><p>如果您有任何问题、建议或合作意向，欢迎通过以下方式与我们联系。</p><div class=\"mt-4 p-4 bg-gray-50 rounded-lg space-y-2\"><p><span class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">邮箱：</span>support@mingliwang.com</p><p><span class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">微信公众号：</span>命理网</p><p><span class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">在线时间：</span>工作日 9:00 - 18:00</p></div><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-400 mt-4\">* 命理分析仅供娱乐参考，请理性看待</p></div></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"relative bg-gradient-to-b from-gray-900 to-gray-950 text-gray-300 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-gold/40 to-transparent\"></div><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-hero-pattern opacity-[0.03]\"></div><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 relative z-10\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-10\"><div class=\"col-span-1 md:col-span-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-4\"><div class=\"w-9 h-9 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-br from-red-700 to-red-900 flex items-center justify-center shadow-md\"><span class=\"text-white font-bold text-sm font-kai\">命</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><span class=\"text-lg font-bold chinese-gold leading-none font-kai\">命理网</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-gold/60 tracking-[0.2em] leading-none mt-1\">MINGLI</span></div></div><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-md\">传承千年智慧，融合现代科技。</p></div><div><h4 class=\"text-white font-semibold mb-4 text-sm tracking-wide\">命理服务</h4><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li><a class=\"text-gray-400 hover:text-gold text-sm transition-colors\" href=\"/bazi\">四柱八字</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-400 hover:text-gold text-sm transition-colors\" href=\"/ziwei\">紫微斗数</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-400 hover:text-gold text-sm transition-colors\" href=\"/qimen\">奇门遁甲</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-400 hover:text-gold text-sm transition-colors\" href=\"/meihua\">梅花易数</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"text-white font-semibold mb-4 text-sm tracking-wide\">关于我们</h4><ul class=\"space-y-3\"><li><a class=\"text-gray-400 hover:text-gold text-sm transition-colors\" href=\"/about\">关于命理网</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-400 hover:text-gold text-sm transition-colors\" href=\"/membership\">会员中心</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-400 hover:text-gold text-sm transition-colors\" href=\"/offering\">在线供奉</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-400 hover:text-gold text-sm transition-colors\" href=\"/contact\">联系我们</a></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"border-t border-gray-800 mt-12 pt-10 text-center\"><p class=\"text-gray-500 text-sm\">© 2026 命理网 · 传承经典，启迪智慧</p></div></div></footer><div class=\"fixed top-4 right-4 z-[9999] flex flex-col gap-2 max-w-sm w-full pointer-events-none\"></div><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-116b974ac6a08e65.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[11761,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-39c9d338aee346d7.js\\\"],\\\"Providers\\\"]\\n3:I[95545,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-39c9d338aee346d7.js\\\"],\\\"Header\\\"]\\n4:I[4707,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"7177\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/layout-39c9d338aee346d7.js\\\"],\\\"ErrorBoundary\\\"]\\n5:I[9766,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n6:I[98924,[],\\\"\\\"]\\n7:I[52619,[\\\"2619\\\",\\\"static/chunks/2619-04bc32f026a0d946.js\\\",\\\"3417\\\",\\\"static/chunks/app/(public)/about/page-6b2d65511ceaf73c.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\